{
	"title": "Écart-type : valeur arrondie",
	"description": "Calculer l'espérance, la variance puis l'écart-type d'une variable aléatoire, arrondi au centième",
	"grades": ["1_SPE"],
	"theme": "Probabilités",
	"domain": "Variables aléatoires",
	"subdomain": "Variance et écart-type",
	"level": 2,
	"status": "draft",
	"delay": 120,
	"shared": {
		"blankDefaults": {
			"acceptDecimal": true
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "La loi de probabilité d'une variable aléatoire $X$ est donnée par le tableau suivant.\n\n| $x_k$ | ${{x1}}$ | ${{x2}}$ | ${{x3}}$ |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| $P(X=x_k)$ | ${{eval:a/10;d}}$ | ${{eval:b/10;d}}$ | ${{eval:c/10;d}}$ |\n\nCalcule l'écart-type $\\sigma(X)$ et donne sa valeur arrondie au centième.\n\n$\\sigma(X)\\approx ?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "x1",
					"expression": "-3..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "d1",
					"expression": "1..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "d2",
					"expression": "1..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "x2",
					"expression": "{{eval:x1+d1}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "x3",
					"expression": "{{eval:x2+d2}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..8"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "1..{{eval:9-a}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "{{eval:10-a-b}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "S",
					"expression": "{{eval:a*(x1)+b*(x2)+c*(x3)}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "Q",
					"expression": "{{eval:a*(x1)^2+b*(x2)^2+c*(x3)^2}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "E",
					"expression": "{{eval:S/10}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "T",
					"expression": "{{eval:10*Q-S*S}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": [
				"abs(10*sqrt(T)-floor(10*sqrt(T))-0.5) > 0.05",
				"mod(round(10*sqrt(T)),10) != 0"
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:round(10*sqrt(T))/100;d}}",
					"precision": {
						"type": "decimal",
						"digits": 2
					}
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Espérance : $E(X)=\\sum p_k x_k={{eval:a/10;d}}\\times {{x1;()}}+{{eval:b/10;d}}\\times {{x2;()}}+{{eval:c/10;d}}\\times {{x3;()}}={{eval:E;d}}$.",
					"Par définition, $V(X)=\\sum p_k\\left(x_k-E(X)\\right)^2$.",
					"$V(X)={{eval:a/10;d}}\\times \\left({{eval:x1-E;d}}\\right)^2+{{eval:b/10;d}}\\times \\left({{eval:x2-E;d}}\\right)^2+{{eval:c/10;d}}\\times \\left({{eval:x3-E;d}}\\right)^2={{eval:T/100;d}}$",
					"Autre méthode (formule de König-Huygens) : $V(X)=E(X^2)-E(X)^2={{eval:Q/10;d}}-\\left({{eval:E;d}}\\right)^2={{eval:T/100;d}}$.",
					"L'écart-type est la racine carrée de la variance : $\\sigma(X)=\\sqrt{ {{eval:T/100;d}} }\\approx\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{eval:round(10*sqrt(T))/100;d}} }$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
